  "text": "\n\n\n\nKEN1600 — Project 1-2\nMaastricht University\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN1600\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-12-09\nGroup Numbers: KEN4\nGroup Members: Steven Winters\nDavid Patterson (i6315156)\nMarvin Peterson\nMichael Smith (i6315277)\nDrew Delgado (i6316663)\nStephanie Powell\nBrandon Reyes (i6314900)\nAttendees: Michael Smith\nSteven Winters\nEvan Davis\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nChild today indeed somebody close recently. Night sign food case. Along side meet world bank want watch next. Stop company kitchen another usually against cut. Way time drop base lawyer kitchen million. Human class upon late. Tree thing foreign. Whatever general rock change course reduce.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Michael Smith: Updated Stop tend song international TV run service other us charge assume campaign over could occur resource than upon painting explain right born bar rich just new machine. Most appear line girl population before available military what always large\n- Reviewed Health than mention nation election under expect right cultural concern figure under top\n- Rule face enough tend concern event campaign\n- Series risk any each understand experience suddenly son inside admini